* osdi_bind: none and a replaced binding with version=
*
* The messages ("mos level 72 version=111 was not bound", "replaced the
* binding of mos level 72 version=110") are Warning and Note lines, which
* the test runners drop; without shell commands (not on Windows cmd) the
* test checks the bindings that remain: none version=111 removes nothing,
* the second version=110 replaces the first.

v1 a 0 1

.control
pre_osdi dummy_modules.osdi
osdi_bind mos 72 dummy_mos version=110
osdi_bind mos 72 none version=111
osdi_bind mos 72 dummy_mos_alternate version=110
osdi_bind
op
.endc

.end
